:"2026-09-03T17:51:13Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123081.\r\n\r\nAn incorrect color was sampled for drop indicator, which is now fixed.\r\n\r\n> <img width=\"368\" height=\"275\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/567b1fad-bd0b-4b73-bba1-0ab9e00823c0\" />\r\n\r\nIn the case that the user has their relationship line opacity set to 1.0, there would be no contrast between the relationship line and the drop indicator line. Addressing that would mean putting the relationship lines on their own CanvasItem, and dimming them during drag should their opacity be close to the drop indicator's. Not sure if that is worth the trouble for what is essentially a user opting out of contrast.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123096/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123096/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason"